{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41579","headline":"塞下三首 三 · 沈彬","name":"塞下三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月冷榆关过鴈行，将军寒笛老思乡。\n贰师骨恨千夫壮，李广魂飞一劒长。\n戍角就沙催落日，阴云分碛护飞霜。\n谁知汉武轻中国，闲夺天山草木荒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈彬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41579.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41579","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}